  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The formula for maximum current is given by&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>The given data is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi></math></p><p>Substituting the values in equation (i)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>120</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>150</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>036</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
